<!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"7e0c8ddc-fa94-4486-bdb9-58050268a0d1","blockVersion":"2","content":"Awaiting Order Arrival","tpFontSizeMobile":"22"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-7e0c8ddc">Awaiting Order Arrival</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion {"blockId":"dc0d3bcd-8d2f-474f-b7e6-5344c703b700","blockVersion":"2","design":"simple","allClosed":true,"paneSize":15,"titleTpFontSize":"18","titlesColorCode":"#242424","titlesHoverColorVariable":"\u002d\u002dwd-primary-color","titlesActiveColorVariable":"\u002d\u002dwd-primary-color","bgColorCode":"#ffffff","paddingTop":"15","paddingRight":"30","paddingBottom":"15","paddingLeft":"30","marginBottom":"40","borderRadius":"20","borderRadiusTop":"20","borderRadiusRight":"20","borderRadiusBottom":"20","borderRadiusLeft":"20"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion wd-accordion wd-style-simple wd-titles-start wd-opener-style-arrow wd-opener-pos-end wd-dc0d3bcd" data-state="all"><!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"2c377971-4bde-478e-a43c-0e8c78260a23","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"solid","borderColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.11)","borderWidthBottom":"1"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-2c377971"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>I received my order after getting a refund. What can I do?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"2cd8a34d-c5c7-4e24-9323-ac8cf104c0e7","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-2cd8a34d">Keep the product in its original packaging along with all documents confirming the purchase and refund. You will need this for further communication with the seller and the payment system.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"8e062d43-dd8f-4622-b01b-1bf99a945dc8","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"solid","borderColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.11)","borderWidthBottom":"1"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-8e062d43"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>I haven't received my order. What should I do?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"50716d7f-5d1e-4134-97ab-d1bacbc367c1","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-50716d7f">Check the email you received after placing your order. It should contain information about the status of your order and the expected delivery date.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"cf75e4ec-8ed1-4883-bced-16b298ef76b0","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"solid","borderColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.11)","borderWidthBottom":"1"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-cf75e4ec"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>What if the package is held by customs?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"85319e45-d32f-4ad4-8408-5c65aefa7068","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-85319e45">If the contents of the parcel are suspicious to customs officers (for example, many identical goods), it may be further checked.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"6e2ad147-c3ff-4ece-90df-7fd0306e1295","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"solid","borderColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.11)","borderWidthBottom":"1"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-6e2ad147"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>If the resolution time for the dispute is excessively prolonged, and you prefer not to wait, what actions should be taken?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"f8824bce-7916-4cf5-9b6b-ab0f36e0d7e8","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-f8824bce">If all other options fail, you may need to consider taking legal action. This can be a lengthy and costly process, so it's important to weigh the potential benefits against the risks and costs.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"f8a378e0-8d6e-47c7-8dda-aa281721e7e4","blockVersion":"2"} -->
