<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"825e810e-82f8-4c84-8ddd-34d952a31d61","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"solid","borderColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.11)","borderWidthBottom":"1"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-825e810e"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Do you deliver to my postcode?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"85319e45-d32f-4ad4-8408-5c65aefa7068","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-85319e45">If the contents of the parcel are suspicious to customs officers (for example, many identical goods), it may be further checked.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"8651f67d-acd7-4068-b775-d5f15d11be74","blockVersion":"2","borderType":"solid","borderColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.11)","borderWidthBottom":"1"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-8651f67d"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Is next-day delivery available on all orders?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"f8824bce-7916-4cf5-9b6b-ab0f36e0d7e8","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-f8824bce">If all other options fail, you may need to consider taking legal action. This can be a lengthy and costly process, so it's important to weigh the potential benefits against the risks and costs.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"6982f1ec-c8bb-4e7c-955a-d1e8a6567c8b","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-6982f1ec"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Do I need to be there to sign for delivery?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"d99f45cf-be3b-45d3-8cb7-d49a37626bf7","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-d99f45cf">Track the status of your order: Woodmart marketplace provides the ability to track the status of an order by tracking number.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion --></div>
